editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-35.md-294-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-35.md:295:The lines had stood behind his eyes for an hour, as each of the eleven had stood, and he had not looked at them. He had had a lamp to hold, and then a thing to say. He took them now, on a stair, a tread at a time, as he had taken the last upon a pallet: slowly, from the top, in the plain words in which they would have to go into Hesk's book.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-35.md-296-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-35.md:297:*Rune-adjacent. Cleon. Partial. Rune family. A made thing's lean — the direction a maker put in it; which mark bears, which is borne, which is nothing; whether a run sits or goes. Structure, not meaning: it will tell me a thing is an instruction and will not tell me what it instructs. Made things only. Not a river. Not a man. Costs the eyes, after. No use in a fight. Engagement field: inscriptive — the second field that is not a fight, after clinical; given, not taken. Tier equivalent unknown. Deployment: none. Twelfth.*
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-35.md-298-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-35.md-299-Twelve.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-35.md-300-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-35.md-301-He went over what was new in it, a step at a time, since there was nothing else to be done on those steps. It had a field that he had never met. Nine of his had come out of fights and said so; one said *clinical*, and that had been a healer's hands. Here was a thing that had come to him off a sheet of paper, across a table, from a man describing what he saw. The lines had found a word for that. They had found two more that he read three times over. Every other piece that he carried had been got by standing where somebody was hurt, or hurting. This one said that it had been handed to him.
