editions/monroe-1.3/book-08-before-the-paths/manuscript/chapter-19.md-63-"So I know what leaving is," said Oryn. "I've done it the once. It's when you go and you don't mean to come back to it, and you don't tell them where you'll be. I'll not have this mistaken for that."
