| Keep reading | **8/10.** The discoveries arrive often enough, and the last eastward line is clear; the markers are the only serious brakes. | **9/10.** Every apparent closure opens a larger problem, culminating in two findings that do not agree. | `chapter-46.md:293–343`; **high** |
