+- `bash editions/monroe-1.3/tools/sweep_probe.sh book-08-before-the-paths 7 7`: ch41 0/13, ch42 0/12, ch43 0/12, ch44 0/12, ch45 4/15, ch46 1/11; total **1% skeleton / 13% close**.
+
