+- **Chapter 46:** 218 quote marks, 28 emphasis markers, five dividers. “The twelfth” keeps the inward sequence trackable; Oryn gives the finding before sitting; the leaf refusal and last term have clean speaker ownership; Lira's vault memory is true and audible.
